## Auth flows (legacy board until merged into Copy)

**Source:** [Figma — Way-Two](https://www.figma.com/design/X9k3exHF4liOg4Iwy8VlSm/Way-Two?node-id=52-791)  
**Node:** 52:791 (auth flows board)  
**Screen ref:** [107:785](https://www.figma.com/design/X9k3exHF4liOg4Iwy8VlSm/Way-Two?node-id=107-785) — login/register entry

## Auth Flow (User Journey)

Start screen → Login screen → Account create → Forgot password → Password reset link → Email sent → Success / Error

States: "Waiting for user action (confirm email, link click)", "User created and logged in", "Temporary password sent"

## Flow-Specific Gradient Headers

| Flow | Header gradient |
|------|-----------------|
| Login / Sign up | Purple / blue |
| Forgot password | Green / teal |
| Change password | Orange / purple |

## Screen Types & Copy

### Login / Sign up
- Header: "Connect to continue" / "Подключитесь, чтобы продолжить"
- Email step: "Enter your email", placeholder "Email", CTA "Continue"
- Password step: "Enter your password", placeholder "Password", CTA "Continue"
- Secondary: "Do you already have an account?" → "Log in" | "Forgot password?"

### Forgot password
- Header: "Forgot password"
- Instruction: "Enter your email"
- CTA: "Continue"
- Secondary: "Go back to login"

### Change password
- Header: "Change password"
- Secondary: "Cancel", "Try again" (on error)
- Create step: "Create new password", placeholder "New password"
- Confirm step: "Confirm new password", placeholder "Confirm password"
- CTA: "Change", "Continue"
- Error: "Something went wrong"

## UI Components

**Inputs:** Name, Email, Password, Confirm Password (dark theme, labels, empty/filled/active states)

**Buttons:** Continue, Back, Next, Save, Cancel, Delete (solid primary, outlined secondary)

## Theme

- **Background:** Dark gradient header per flow → solid black
- **Text:** White / light; buttons: black text on white
- **Primary language:** Ukrainian (en + uk support)

